### Friendship System - Corrected Test Flow
### All routes use correct paths (NO /api prefix)
### Flow: Register → Login → Create Profile → Search → Friend Requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = 
@refreshToken = 
@userId = 
@requestId = 

### ============================================
### STEP 1: User Alice - Register
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### STEP 2: User Alice - Login (save accessToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### STEP 3: User Alice - Create Profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice_user",
  "bio": "Hi, I'm Alice!"
}

### ============================================
### STEP 4: User Bob - Register
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### STEP 5: User Bob - Login (save as separate token if testing simultaneously)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### STEP 6: User Bob - Create Profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob_user",
  "bio": "Hey, I'm Bob!"
}

### ============================================
### STEP 7: Search Users (correct path: /users/search)
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/search?q=alice
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### STEP 8: Send Friend Request
### ============================================
### Save userId from search results, then use it here
POST {{baseUrl}}/friends/request/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### ============================================
### STEP 9: Get Pending Friend Requests
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### STEP 10: Accept Friend Request
### ============================================
### Save requestId from pending requests
POST {{baseUrl}}/friends/accept/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### ============================================
### STEP 11: Get Friends List
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### STEP 12: Check Friendship Status
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/friends/check/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### Alternative: Reject Friend Request
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/friends/reject/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### ============================================
### Alternative: Remove Friend
### ============================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/friends/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
